# Web feature modules

- Domain code in `src/features/<name>/` with `api/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `pages/`, `types.ts`
- Components call `features/*/api/` — no raw `fetch` in UI components
- App shell: `src/app/{App,providers,router}.tsx`; shared UI in `src/components/`
- Env via `src/lib/env.ts` (`VITE_*` only); helpers in `src/lib/utils.ts`
- Use `@/` imports; keep `src/pages/` thin (re-exports)
- No Clerk/auth providers unless asked
